<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>MATCH MADE IN HELL</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Dutch Melrose, benny mayne</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">MATCH MADE IN HELL</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">144JlWqlpgkmLuRU0PvRQt</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.192" end="00:10.035">Before I met you (met you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.035" end="00:13.037">World was up in flames with my head in the sand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.037" end="00:15.397">It's coincidental ('dental)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.397" end="00:18.975">You would love to watch it burn with you holdin' my hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.975" end="00:22.476">I let the devil go make my bed (my bed)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.476" end="00:24.901">And now it's time to lay in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.901" end="00:28.329">How could I resist with them lips bright red? (Bright red)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.329" end="00:30.466">Leavin' stains on my cigarette</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.466" end="00:36.253">I, I, I never thought I'd find true love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.253" end="00:41.339">I, I guess I wasn't looking hard enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.339" end="00:47.298">If my heart stops now, you're the one thing that made it all worth it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.298" end="00:53.935">If the sky falls down, right now, you're the one that I'll worship</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.935" end="00:56.902">Pretty angel caught in the crossfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.902" end="01:00.571">Let me wipe those golden tears from your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.571" end="01:06.643">It must've hurt how fast you fell for a match made in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.643" end="01:12.474">For a match made in hell (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.474" end="01:15.380">we missed it all rollin' the dice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.380" end="01:18.362">Oh, what a twisted paradise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.362" end="01:21.488">I set our world right up in flames</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.488" end="01:24.280">Just to keep you warm at night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.280" end="01:27.615">You let the devil go make your bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.615" end="01:30.065">And now it's time to lay in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.065" end="01:33.359">How could I resist with them lips bright red? (Bright red)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.359" end="01:38.749">Leaving stains on my cigarette</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.749" end="01:41.694">I never thought I'd find true love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.694" end="01:46.529">(I, I) guess I wasn't lookin' hard enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.529" end="01:52.450">If my heart stops now, you're the one thing that made it all worth it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.450" end="01:59.100">If the sky falls down, right now, you're the one that I'll worship</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.100" end="02:02.081">Pretty angel caught in the crossfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.081" end="02:05.652">Let me wipe those golden tears from your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.652" end="02:08.737">It must've hurt how fast you fell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.737" end="02:10.393">For a match made in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.393" end="02:16.254">If my heart stops now, you're the one thing that made it all worth it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.254" end="02:22.830">If the sky falls down, right now, you're the one that I'll worship (that I'll worship)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.830" end="02:25.760">Pretty angel guardin' a crossfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.760" end="02:29.406">Let me wipe those golden tears from your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.406" end="02:32.482">It must've hurt how fast you fell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.482" end="02:36.482">For a match made in hell</p></div></body></tt>